{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/431903483","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/431903483/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/releases/431903483/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/releases/tag/v5.2.6","id":431903483,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOLAFUFM4ZvlL7","tag_name":"v5.2.6","target_commitish":"main","name":"v5.2.6: Fix step hanging after a failed cache restore","draft":false,"immutable":true,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-11-02T19:54:22Z","updated_at":"2026-11-02T19:55:39Z","published_at":"2026-11-02T19:54:50Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/tarball/v5.2.6","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mise-action/zipball/v5.2.6","body":"The action now exits as soon as its work is done. Before this release, a cache restore that failed during the download could leave the step running for up to ten minutes after setup had finished.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- **A failed cache restore no longer leaves the step hanging.** If the mise cache download failed partway through, for example with `getaddrinfo EAI_AGAIN`, the action logged a warning, installed the tools and saved the cache, then stopped producing output. The step stayed in progress until the job was cancelled or a timer inside `@actions/cache` fired after 10 minutes. That timer is left running when a download fails (actions/toolkit#2470), and it kept the Node process alive. The action now exits explicitly after both the main step and the post step finish. It waits up to 5 seconds for log output to flush, then exits. The exit code set by any earlier failure is kept. Errors that aren't `Error` objects now mark the step as failed with their message. Before, they caused an unhandled rejection. ([#718](https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/pull/718) by @jdx and @kjanat, fixes [#717](https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/issues/717))\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jdx/mise-action/compare/v5.2.5...v5.2.6","mentions_count":2}